#, no-wrap
msgid "[Design principles of operator representations](operators#operators-explanation) explains the operator data structure that carries the group indices, and how its terms are stored and ordered.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapaliwanag ng [Mga prinsipyo ng disenyo ng mga representasyon ng operator](operators#operators-explanation) ang data structure ng operator na may dala ng mga group index, at kung paano iniimbak at inaayos ang mga term nito.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
